Subject: [PATCH 07/58] worker: index the persistent per-request-slot block
 table under PP

Under pipeline parallelism the Mamba/GDN state-copy path indexed a block-table
row gathered for a different step. The align post-process now indexes the
persistent per-request-slot table, and fails closed when it is absent.
